EXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">-방송에 관심이 있고 최선을 다할 의지가 있는 학생</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #c37d71; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">┃</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">모집 부문</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><img height=\"1\" src=\"file:///C:/DOCUME~1/USER/LOCALS~1/Temp/Hnc/BinData/EMB00000764073c.gif\" width=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">-수습국원 선발 시에는 부서를 나누지 않고 선발</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">-수습국원으로 선발된 후 한학기동안의 수습생활을 통해 제작부, 보도부, 방송부, 기술부, 영상부로 부서 결정</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #c37d71; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">┃</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">선발 방법</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><img height=\"1\" src=\"file:///C:/DOCUME~1/USER/LOCALS~1/Temp/Hnc/BinData/EMB00000764073d.gif\" width=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">-최초 면접과&nbsp;아나운싱 테스트를&nbsp;거친&nbsp;지원자 중&nbsp;실무진들의&nbsp;심의 및 주간 교수의 최종 면접을&nbsp;통해&nbsp;선발</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #c37d71; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">┃</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">합격자 발표</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><img height=\"1\" src=\"file:///C:/DOCUME~1/USER/LOCALS~1/Temp/Hnc/BinData/EMB00000764073e.gif\" width=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">-시험 익일 방송국내 게시판에 합격자 게시 혹은 개별 통보</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #c37d71; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">┃</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">수습국원 과정</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br><img height=\"1\" src=\"file:///C:/DOCUME~1/USER/LOCALS~1/Temp/Hnc/BinData/EMB00000764073f.gif\" width=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 5pt; TEXT-INDENT: -5pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">-수습국원으로 선발된 후 한 학기 동안 수습국원에게 필요한&nbsp;방송의 기본적인 교양을 쌓고,&nbsp;제작, 보도, 방송, 기술, 영상 5가지 분야의 방송지식을 습득</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">-대학 방송인으로서의 재능을 준비</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;한컴바탕&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
